T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Display Modes: block \(occupies 100% width, starts on new line: div, p, h1\), inline) Tj
T*
(\(occupies only content width, ignores top/bottom margin/padding: span, a\),) Tj
T*
(inline-block \(flows inline, but respects width, height, padding, margin\), none) Tj
T*
(\(removes element from DOM layout\).) Tj
T*
(* Positioning Schemes \(position\):) Tj
T*
(- static \(Default\): Normal document flow.) Tj
T*
(- relative: Positioned relative to its normal flow position \(top, left\) without) Tj
T*
(affecting surrounding layout.) Tj
T*
(- absolute: Removed from document flow; positioned relative to nearest positioned) Tj
T*
(ancestor \(non-static\).) Tj
T*
(- fixed: Positioned relative to the browser viewport; remains stationary during page) Tj
T*
(scrolling.) Tj
T*
(- sticky: Toggles between relative and fixed depending on scroll threshold.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 2.4 Flexbox \(One-Dimensional Flexible Box Layout\)) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(Flexbox aligns items along a single dimension \(either row or column\) with dynamic space) Tj
T*
(distribution:) Tj
T*
(* Flex Container Properties: display: flex; flex-direction: row | column; flex-wrap:) Tj
T*
(nowrap | wrap; justify-content: flex-start | center | space-between | space-around |) Tj
T*
(space-evenly \(aligns along main axis\); align-items: stretch | center | flex-start |) Tj
T*
(flex-end \(aligns along cross axis\).) Tj
T*
(* Flex Item Properties: flex-grow \(expansion factor\), flex-shrink \(shrinkage) Tj
T*
(resistance\), flex-basis \(initial size\), align-self \(overrides container alignment\).) Tj
T*
(Shorthand: flex: 1 1 auto.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 2.5 CSS Grid \(Two-Dimensional Layout Architecture\)) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(CSS Grid provides simultaneous multi-row and multi-column control:) Tj
T*
(* Container Properties: display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat\(3, 1fr\) \(three) Tj
T*
(equal fractional columns\); grid-template-rows; gap: 20px \(row and column gutters\);) Tj
T*
(grid-template-areas: 'header header' 'nav main' 'footer footer'.) Tj
T*
(* Item Placement: grid-column: 1 / 3; grid-row: 2 / 4; grid-area: header.) Tj
